`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Project knowledge enhances Claude's understanding"})," by letting you upload relevant documents that Claude references across all chats within that project. No more re-uploading the same files each time."]}),`
