`,(0,r.jsx)(i.h3,{id:"how-projects-handle-large-knowledge-bases",children:"How projects handle large knowledge bases"}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"You might wonder what happens when you upload a lot of content. Projects automatically scale to handle large amounts through a process called Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG). At a high level, this means that Claude can automatically find and use the most relevant parts of your uploaded documents when answering, without you needing to tell it which file to look at."}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"When your project knowledge approaches the context window limit, Claude stops loading everything at once and instead searches your project's files, retrieving only what's relevant to your question. This expands your project's capacity by up to 10x while maintaining response quality."}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"You'll see a visual indicator when your project is RAG-enabled, but the experience should feel the same—you can still upload documents, chat with Claude, and get context-aware responses."}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.h2,{id:"working-within-your-project",children:"Working within your project"}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"Once your project is set up, you can start chatting with Claude. Each conversation within the project automatically has access to your knowledge base and follows your project instructions."}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.h2,{id:"collaboration-features",children:"Collaboration features"}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"For users on Claude for Work (Team and Enterprise) plans, projects become even more powerful through collaboration features."}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.h3,{id:"permission-levels",children:"Permission levels"}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"When sharing a project, you can choose from three permission levels:"}),`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.ol,{children:[`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Can view:"})," Members can see project contents, access knowledge, and chat—but can't make changes. Think of this as read-only access with discussion rights."]}),`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Can edit:"})," Members have full collaboration power. They can modify instructions, update knowledge, manage other members, and actively contribute to the project."]}),`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Owner:"})," Project creators control everything, including who sees the project. They can share with specific people or make projects visible to the entire organization."]}),`
`]}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.h3,{id:"sharing-your-project",children:"Sharing your project"}),`
