`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Research support:"})," Centralize your competitive review, user research data, and customer feedback. Claude can help you synthesize sources, draft reports, and maintain consistency across recommendations."]}),`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Client account hub:"})," Keep your client's brand guidelines, past deliverables, and communication history in one place. Set instructions so Claude matches their tone and references their specific context when creating proposals or reports."]}),`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Event planning workspace:"})," Upload venue contracts, speaker bios, and attendee data. Claude can help generate run-of-show documents, attendee communications, and post-event reports that stay consistent with your event's theme."]}),`
`,(0,r.jsxs)(i.li,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.strong,{children:"Job description generator:"})," Gather past job descriptions, team charters, and internal headcount request docs. Work with Claude to draft job descriptions that reflect your team's actual work and culture."]}),`
